{"id":"e6b7ef84cd56a90c","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-dtc.md","title":"确定性传递闭包 DTC","display":"df-dtc — 确定性传递闭包 DTC","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-dtc","aliases":["29-df-dtc"],"display":"df-dtc — 确定性传递闭包 DTC","depends_on":["[[29-df-tc]]"],"source_locator":"§9.2, pp.143–144, DjVu scans 158–159","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-dtc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-dtc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dtc — 确定性传递闭包 DTC"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§9.2, pp.143–144, DjVu scans 158–159"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq V^2\">\\(E\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}_V\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}_V\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_V(E)\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in E\\mid\\forall w\\in V\\;((u,w)\\in E\\to w=v)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_V(E)\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in E\\mid\\forall w\\in V\\;((u,w)\\in E\\to w=v)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DTC}_V(E)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{TC}_V(D_V(E)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DTC}_V(E)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{TC}_V(D_V(E)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §9.2，印刷页 143–144，扫描页 158–159。先删除有多个不同后继的顶点的所有出边，再取反身传递闭包；不任意选择一个后继。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 已为部分函数的图，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_V(E)=E\">\\(D_V(E)=E\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-tc","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc79e14d83be0f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-tc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tc","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc79e14d83be0f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V$ 为有限集合，$E\\subseteq V^2$；$\\operatorname{TC}_V$ 见 [[29-df-tc]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}_V","display":false},{"tex":"D_V(E)\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in E\\mid\\forall w\\in V\\;((u,w)\\in E\\to w=v)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DTC}_V(E)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{TC}_V(D_V(E)).","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"D_V(E)=E","display":false}],"bytes":912,"backlinks":[{"id":"37df1473b45d1ebc","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-dtc]]、[[29-df-fo-dtc]]、[[29-thm-l-fo-dtc]] — DTC 与确定性对数空间"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-dtc]]"}],"outgoing":["e0bc79e14d83be0f"]}